// Reference: designs/2026-04-13-trust_ir-integration.md (adapter layer architecture)
//
// Translates trust_ir (the universal IR from tRust/tSwift/tC) to the internal LIR
// consumed by the ISel. This adapter approach (Option A in the design doc)
// decouples the ISel from trust_ir API changes while preserving proof annotations
// as metadata for downstream optimization passes.

//! trust_ir to internal LIR adapter layer.
//!
//! This module translates `trust_ir_func::Module` / `trust_ir_func::Function` into the
//! internal `trust_cg_lower::function::Function` representation, mapping each trust_ir
//! instruction to one or more internal `Instruction`s.
//!
//! Proof annotations from trust_ir are extracted into a `ProofContext` for consumption
//! by downstream optimization passes (trust-cg-opt).

